      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Virtufin.WebSocketManager.Services.InstanceHeartbeatService",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.WebSocketManager.Services.InstanceHeartbeatService.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Background service that publishes a heartbeat for this instance\nto the Dapr state store on a configured interval and discovers\npeer instance heartbeats to populate the local <code>knownInstances</code>\nset.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.WebSocketManager.Services.InstanceHeartbeatService.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"6\">Without this, <xref href=\"Virtufin.WebSocketManager.Services.ConnectionReclaimerHostedService\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> treats\nevery connection from a different instance ID as a candidate for\nreclamation — which is correct only after the peer has died.\nHeartbeats let live peers advertise their presence so live\nconnections are never reclaimed.</p>\n"
    },
