      "Title": "Virtufin.WebSocketManager.Services.TopicValidator",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.WebSocketManager.Services.TopicValidator.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Validates Dapr pubsub topic names against the patterns in the\n<a href=\"https://git.haenerconsulting.com/virtufin/virtufin-openspec/src/branch/master/openspec/specs/pubsub-topics/spec.md#requirement-topic-patterns\">Pub/Sub Topics spec §Topic Patterns</a>.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.WebSocketManager.Services.TopicValidator.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"4\">The WebSocketManager publishes per-frame user data to caller-supplied\ntopics (the topic passed to <code>StartPublishRequest.topic</code>). Per\n<a href=\"https://git.haenerconsulting.com/virtufin/virtufin-openspec/src/branch/master/openspec/specs/cross-cutting/spec.md\">Cross-cutting spec</a>,\nservices that publish directly to Dapr MUST validate the topic\nname inline against these patterns. This class is the chokepoint\nthat enforces the rule.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.WebSocketManager.Services.TopicValidator.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"11\">Accepted patterns:</p>\n<ol sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.WebSocketManager.Services.TopicValidator.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"12\">\n<li sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.WebSocketManager.Services.TopicValidator.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"12\"><code>&lt;service&gt;.&lt;category&gt;</code>            — Tier 0 / infrastructure\ne.g. <code>websocketmanager.lifecycle</code>, <code>workmanager.infra.worker</code></li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.WebSocketManager.Services.TopicValidator.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"14\"><code>act.exchange.&lt;venue&gt;.&lt;entity&gt;.&lt;event&gt;[.&lt;id&gt;]</code>\n— market data (real, no selector segment)</li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.WebSocketManager.Services.TopicValidator.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"16\"><code>hyp.&lt;selector&gt;.exchange.&lt;venue&gt;.&lt;entity&gt;.&lt;event&gt;[.&lt;id&gt;]</code>\n— market data (hypothetical, with selector)</li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.WebSocketManager.Services.TopicValidator.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"18\"><code>sc.&lt;scenarioId&gt;.&lt;domain&gt;.&lt;entity&gt;.&lt;event&gt;[.&lt;id&gt;]</code>\n— scenario-scoped events</li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.WebSocketManager.Services.TopicValidator.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"20\"><code>command.&lt;service&gt;</code>            — command topics (worker input)</li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.WebSocketManager.Services.TopicValidator.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"21\"><code>response.&lt;service&gt;</code>            — response topics (worker output)</li>\n</ol>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.WebSocketManager.Services.TopicValidator.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"23\">Rejected (intentionally):</p>\n<ul sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.WebSocketManager.Services.TopicValidator.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"24\">\n<li sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.WebSocketManager.Services.TopicValidator.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"24\"><code>act.&lt;selector&gt;.exchange.*</code>     — act topics MUST NOT carry a selector</li>\n<li sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.WebSocketManager.Services.TopicValidator.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"25\"><code>hyp.exchange.*</code>                  — hyp topics MUST carry a selector</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
